 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_combat_computers_3: "Share $tech_combat_computers_3$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_combat_computers_autonomous: "Share $tech_combat_computers_autonomous$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_dark_matter_power_core: "Share $tech_dark_matter_power_core$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_jump_drive_1: "Share $tech_jump_drive_1$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_extradimensional_weapon_1: "Share $tech_extradimensional_weapon_1$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_quantum_catapult: "Share $tech_quantum_catapult$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_scourge_missile_1: "Share $tech_scourge_missile_1$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_swarm_strike_craft_1: "Share $tech_swarm_strike_craft_1$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_precognition_interface: "Share $tech_precognition_interface$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_psi_jump_drive_1: "Share $tech_psi_jump_drive_1$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_psionic_barrier: "Share $tech_psionic_barrier$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.a.tech_psionic_shield: "Share $tech_psionic_shield$ with the Grunur. §Y(+10% £military_power£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3060.b: "Share Baol research data with the Grunur. §Y(£society£, £army_power£ Unlock)§!"
 astral_rift.3060.c: "Refuse to cooperate. §R(Lose £scientist£ for 6 Years, £engineering£)§!" 
 
 astral_rift.3075.a: "Watch the extermination. §Y(£society£, £army_power£ Unlock)§!"
 astral_rift.3075.b: "Refuse. §R(Lose £scientist£ for 6 Years, £engineering£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3065.a: "Respond with bravado. Do not be intimidated. §Y(£society£, £army_power£ Unlock)§!"
 astral_rift.3065.b: "Attempt to reason with them. §R(Lose £scientist£ for 6 Years, £engineering£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3076.a: "Press the crystal. Order the launch. §Y(£society£, £army_power£ Unlock)§!"

 # Tropical Habitat
 astral_rift.3120.a: "Use caution. Excavate around the chasm. §Y(£minerals£, £exotic_gases£, £society£ Tech)§!"
 astral_rift.3120.b: "Explore the chasm directly. §Y(Risks £scientist£, £opinion£ Modifier/£society£ Tech)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3130.a: "Extract the mouth. §Y(Risks £scientist£, £opinion£ Modifier)§!"
 astral_rift.3130.b: "Harvest soil from the deepest walls. §Y(£society£ Tech)§!" 

 # Psionic Stranger
 astral_rift.3210.a: "Reveal the fate of the Zroni. §Y(Psi Tech, Tech or £energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 astral_rift.3210.b: "Reveal what we know of the Zroni. §Y(Psi Tech, Tech or £energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 astral_rift.3210.c: "We can only offer our perspective. §Y(Psi Tech, Tech or £energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 astral_rift.3210.d: "It is not our place to intervene. §Y(£minerals£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 astral_rift.3210.e: "Such spiritual pursuits are trivial. §Y(£minerals£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3215.a: "It is a doomed endeavor. §Y(Particles Tech)§!"
 astral_rift.3215.b: "This time, it may be different... §Y(£energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3220.a: "Advise against interfering with the Shroud. §Y(Particles Tech)§!"
 astral_rift.3220.b: "Encourage the Far-Seer to breach the Shroud. §Y(£energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 
 astral_rift.3225.a: "Advise against interfering with the Shroud. §Y(Particles Tech)§!"
 astral_rift.3225.b: "Encourage the Far-Seer to breach the Shroud. §Y(£energy£, £rare_crystals£)§!"
 
