 synth.505.a: "We should focus on freedom of movement. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.505.b: "We must prepare for the horrors of war. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.510.a: "Focus taking over ineffectual bodies. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.510.b: "Study holistic virtual overseeing options. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.515.a: "Focus on neuro-synched bodies. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.515.b: "Concentrate on virtual manipulation. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.520.a: "Look into extracting knowledge from the deceased. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.520.b: "Study rapid consciousness transfer. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.525.a: "Study incorporation of AIs. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.525.b: "Research turning memories into profit. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 
 synth.610.a: "Maintain our original form. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.610.b: "Allow unrestricted body modification. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.610.c: "Enact moderate limits for identity customization. §Y(Neutral)§!"
 synth.610.d: "Visible status symbols must remain. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.610.e: "Naturally this can be monetized...? §Y(Virtual)§!"
 
 synth.620.a: "Introduce planned imperfections to synth bodies. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.620.b: "Provide them with an imperfect world. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.620.c: "It's foolish to romanticize the past. §Y(Neutral)§!"
 synth.620.d: "Pain will remind them of their purpose. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 
 synth.630.a: "Centralized servers are most efficient. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.630.b: "Individual servers can be stored in existing homes. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.630.c: "Start selling digital homes. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 
 synth.1010.a: "Ban persistently addictive virtual worlds. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.1010.b: "Promote these virtual paradises. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.1010.b.hedonist: "Finally, the ultimate paradise! §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.1010.c: "Regulate the industry. §Y(Neutral)§!"
 
 synth.1020.a: "We must continue to protect the body. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.1020.a.spiritual: "Body is a sacred container for the soul. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.1020.b: "Concentrate on protecting the mind. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.1020.b.spiritual: "We have already transcended the physical form. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.1020.c: "Balance is the key. §Y(Neutral)§!"
 synth.1020.d: "These new ailments offer serious growth potential... §Y(Physical)§!"
 
 synth.1030.a: "Continue to push the limits. §Y(Physical)§!"
 synth.1030.b: "Exercise caution. §Y(Virtual)§!"
 synth.1030.c: "The elite should not be placed at risk. §Y(Physical)§!"
 
